== Notes ==
* The Scourge is instantly killed by {{I|Meat Cleaver}}.

== Trivia ==
* The Scourge gets its name from a type of [[Wikipedia:Scourge|whip]].
* The Scourge resembles the {{e|Snapper}} monster, as they both attack using long, tendril-like whips, have a bottom row of teeth, and have an eye in the middle of their mouth.
** It also resembles the {{e|Cultist}} monster, in terms of appearance.

